#: ui/ColorProfileSelector.qml:68
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Use the color profile built into the screen itself, if present. Note that "
"built-in color profiles are sometimes wrong, and often inaccurate. For "
"optimal color fidelity, calibration using a colorimeter is recommended."
msgstr ""
"Koristi profil boja ugrađen u sam ekran, ako postoji. Imajte u vidu da su "
"ugrađeni profili boja ponekad pogrešni, a često i neprecizni. Za najtačnije "
"boje preporučuje se kalibracija kolorimetrom."

