#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:47
#, kde-format
msgid "Change Screen Priorities…"
msgstr "Izmeni prioritete ekrana…"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:60
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"This determines which screen your main desktop appears on, along with any "
"Plasma Panels in it. Some older games also use this setting to decide which "
"screen to appear on.<nl/><nl/>It has no effect on what screen notifications "
"or other windows appear on."
msgstr ""
"Ovo određuje na kom ekranu se pojavljuje vaša glavna površ, zajedno sa svim "
"plasma panelima na njoj. Neke starije igre takođe koriste ovu postavku da "
"odrede na kom će se ekranu pojaviti.<nl/><nl/>Nema uticaja na to na kom "
"ekranu se pojavljuju obaveštenja ili drugi prozori."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:66
#, kde-format
msgid "Resolution:"
msgstr "Rezolucija:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:91
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "“%1” is the only resolution supported by this display."
msgstr "„%1“ je jedina rezolucija koju ovaj ekran podržava."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:96
#, kde-format
msgid "Scale:"
msgstr "Razmera:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:108
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info accessible description of slider value"
msgid "in percent of regular scale"
msgstr "u procentima od uobičajene razmere"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:139
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Global scale factor expressed in percentage form"
msgid "%1%"
msgstr "%1%"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:154
#, kde-format
msgid "Refresh rate:"
msgstr "Osvežavanje:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:178
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid "“%1” is the only refresh rate supported by this display."
msgstr "„%1“ je jedina učestanost osvežavanja koju ovaj ekran podržava."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:179
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"“%1” is the only refresh rate supported by this display at the current "
"resolution."
msgstr ""
"„%1“ je jedina učestanost osvežavanja koju ovaj ekran podržava pri trenutnoj "
"rezoluciji."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:184
#, kde-format
msgid "Adaptive sync:"
msgstr "Prilagodljiva sinhronizacija:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:189
#, kde-format
msgid "Never"
msgstr "nikad"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:191
#, kde-format
msgid "Always"
msgstr "uvek"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:202
#, kde-format
msgid "Overscan:"
msgstr "Nadskeniranje:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:214
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Overscan expressed in percentage form"
msgid "%1%"
msgstr "%1%"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:220
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Determines how much padding is put around the image sent to the display to "
"compensate for part of the content being cut off around the edges.<nl/><nl/"
">This is sometimes needed when using a TV as a screen."
msgstr ""
"Određuje koliki se prazan okvir dodaje oko slike koja se šalje ekranu, da bi "
"se nadoknadilo isecanje dela sadržaja uz ivice.<nl/><nl/>Ovo je ponekad "
"potrebno kada se TV koristi kao ekran."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:225
#, kde-format
msgid "RGB range:"
msgstr "RGB opseg:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:232
#, kde-format
msgid "Full"
msgstr "pun"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:233
#, kde-format
msgid "Limited"
msgstr "ograničen"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:243
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Determines whether the range of possible color values needs to be limited "
"for the display. This should only be changed if the colors on the screen "
"look washed out."
msgstr ""
"Određuje da li opseg mogućih vrednosti boja treba ograničiti za ekran. Ovo "
"treba menjati samo ako boje na ekranu izgledaju isprano."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:296
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "High Dynamic Range:"
msgstr "Visok dinamički opseg:"

# >> @item
#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:302
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Enable &HDR"
msgstr "&Uključi HDR"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:308
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"HDR allows compatible applications to show brighter and more vivid colors."
msgstr ""
"HDR omogućava saglasnim programima da prikazuju svetlije i življe boje."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:316
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Calibrate HDR Brightness…"
msgstr "Kalibriši HDR osvetljaj…"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:329
#, kde-format
msgid "Opens a window to calibrate HDR brightness"
msgstr "Otvara prozor za kalibrisanje HDR osvetljaja"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:334
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "HDR calibration can only be started if all settings are applied."
msgstr ""
"HDR kalibracija može da se pokrene samo ako su sve postavke primenjene."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:339
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Color accuracy:"
msgstr "Tačnost boja:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:347
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox tradeoff between efficiency and color accuracy"
msgid "Prefer efficiency"
msgstr "prednost efikasnosti"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:348
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox tradeoff between efficiency and color accuracy"
msgid "Prefer color accuracy"
msgstr "prednost tačnosti boja"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:360
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Preferring color accuracy limits potentially inaccurate offloading of color "
"operations to the display driver and increases the maximum color resolution."
"<nl/><nl/>Note that this setting can have a large impact on performance."
msgstr ""
"Davanje prednosti tačnosti boja ograničava potencijalno neprecizno "
"prebacivanje operacija nad bojama na drajver ekrana i povećava najveću "
"rezoluciju boja.<nl/><nl/>Imajte u vidu da ova postavka može znatno da utiče "
"na performanse."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:366
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Preferring efficiency simplifies the ICC profile to matrix+shaper, improving "
"performance at the cost of color accuracy.<nl/><nl/>Note that changing this "
"setting can have a large impact on performance."
msgstr ""
"Davanje prednosti efikasnosti svodi profil ICC na oblik „matrica + kriva“, "
"što poboljšava performanse na uštrb tačnosti boja.<nl/><nl/>Imajte u vidu da "
"izmena ove postavke može znatno da utiče na performanse."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:373
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label:listbox"
msgid "Limit color resolution to:"
msgstr "Ograniči rezoluciju boja na:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:393
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox color resolution"
msgid "Automatic  (%1 bits per color)"
msgstr "automatski  (%1 bita po boji)"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:395 ui/OutputPanel.qml:408
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox color resolution"
msgid "%1 bits per color"
msgstr "%1 bita po boji"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:406
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@item:inlistbox color resolution"
msgid "Automatic (%1 bits per color)"
msgstr "automatski (%1 bita po boji)"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:419
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Limits the color resolution of the image that is sent to the display. This "
"does not affect screenshots or recordings.<nl/><nl/>Because the display is "
"currently connected through a dock, automatic color resolution has been "
"temporarily reduced to 8 bits to avoid common dock issues.<nl/><nl/>Due to "
"graphics driver limitations, the actually used resolution cannot be known."
msgstr ""
"Ograničava rezoluciju boja slike koja se šalje ekranu. Ovo ne utiče na "
"snimke ekrana ni na video snimke.<nl/><nl/>Pošto je ekran trenutno povezan "
"preko sidrišne stanice, automatska rezolucija boja privremeno je smanjena na "
"8 bita, da bi se izbegli česti problemi sa sidrišnim stanicama.<nl/><nl/"
">Zbog ograničenja grafičkih drajvera, stvarno korišćena rezolucija ne može "
"da se sazna."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:423
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Limits the color resolution of the image that is sent to the display. This "
"does not affect screenshots or recordings.<nl/><nl/>Limiting color "
"resolution can be useful to work around display or graphics driver issues."
"<nl/><nl/>Due to graphics driver limitations, the actually used resolution "
"cannot be known."
msgstr ""
"Ograničava rezoluciju boja slike koja se šalje ekranu. Ovo ne utiče na "
"snimke ekrana ni na video snimke.<nl/><nl/>Ograničavanje rezolucije boja "
"može da pomogne da se zaobiđu problemi sa ekranom ili grafičkim drajverom."
"<nl/><nl/>Zbog ograničenja grafičkih drajvera, stvarno korišćena rezolucija "
"ne može da se sazna."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:432
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "sRGB color intensity:"
msgstr "Intenzitet sRGB boja:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:469
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Color intensity factor expressed in percentage form"
msgid "%1%"
msgstr "%1%"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:478
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid "Increases the intensity of sRGB content on the screen."
msgstr "Povećava intenzitet sRGB sadržaja na ekranu."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:483
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Adaptive Backlight Modulation:"
msgstr "Prilagodljiva modulacija pozadinskog osvetljenja:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:513
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Adaptive backlight modulation reduces power use at the cost of color accuracy"
msgstr ""
"Prilagodljiva modulacija pozadinskog osvetljenja smanjuje potrošnju energije "
"na uštrb tačnosti boja"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:519
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Brightness:"
msgstr "Osvetljaj:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:525
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Control hardware brightness with DDC/CI"
msgstr "Upravljaj hardverskim osvetljajem preko DDC/CI"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:531
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"DDC/CI is a feature supported by many monitors. Plasma can use it to adjust "
"screen brightness with desktop controls, as if using the monitor's own "
"hardware buttons and OSD menu."
msgstr ""
"DDC/CI je mogućnost koju podržavaju mnogi monitori. Plasma može da je "
"koristi za podešavanje osvetljaja ekrana kontrolama površi, kao da koristite "
"hardverske tastere i ekranski meni samog monitora."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:568
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Brightness expressed in percentage form"
msgid "%1%"
msgstr "%1%"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:579
#, kde-format
msgid "Automatically adapt to environment"
msgstr "Automatski prilagodi okruženju"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:584
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Automatically adjust the screen’s brightness based on the lighting level of "
"the environment, as detected by the device’s ambient light sensor. If you "
"adjust the brightness manually, those adjustments will be remembered and "
"taken into account."
msgstr ""
"Automatski podešavaj osvetljaj ekrana prema osvetljenosti okoline, koju meri "
"senzor ambijentalne svetlosti uređaja. Ako ručno podesite osvetljaj, ta "
"podešavanja će biti zapamćena i uzeta u obzir."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:590
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Sharpness:"
msgstr "Oštrina:"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:623
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Extended Dynamic Range:"
msgstr "Prošireni dinamički opseg:"

# >> @item
#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:629
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Enable EDR"
msgstr "Uključi EDR"

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:635
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"EDR allows viewing HDR content on SDR displays by dynamically adjusting the "
"backlight.<nl/><nl/>Note that this increases battery usage while viewing HDR "
"content."
msgstr ""
"EDR omogućava gledanje HDR sadržaja na SDR ekranima dinamičkim podešavanjem "
"pozadinskog osvetljenja.<nl/><nl/>Imajte u vidu da ovo povećava potrošnju "
"baterije tokom gledanja HDR sadržaja."

#: ui/OutputPanel.qml:640
#, kde-format
msgid "Replica of:"
msgstr "Preslikava:"

#: ui/Panel.qml:70
#, kde-format
msgid "Legacy applications (X11):"
msgstr "Stari programi (X11):"

#: ui/Panel.qml:73
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The apps themselves should scale to fit the displays"
msgid "Apply scaling themselves"
msgstr "sami primenjuju skaliranje"

#: ui/Panel.qml:78
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Legacy applications that support scaling will use it and look crisp, however "
"those that don’t will not be scaled at all."
msgstr ""
"Stari programi koji podržavaju skaliranje koristiće ga i izgledaće oštro, "
"ali oni koji ga ne podržavaju neće uopšte biti skalirani."

#: ui/Panel.qml:84
#, kde-format
msgctxt "The system will perform the x11 apps scaling"
msgid "Scaled by the system"
msgstr "skalira ih sistem"

#: ui/Panel.qml:89
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"All legacy applications will be scaled by the system to the correct size, "
"however they will always look slightly blurry."
msgstr ""
"Sistem će skalirati sve stare programe na odgovarajuću veličinu, ali će oni "
"uvek izgledati malo mutno."

#: ui/Panel.qml:94
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@label"
msgid "Screen tearing:"
msgstr "Cepanje slike:"

#: ui/Panel.qml:96
#, kde-format
msgctxt ""
"@option:check The thing being allowed in fullscreen windows is screen tearing"
msgid "Allow in fullscreen windows"
msgstr "Dozvoli u prozorima preko celog ekrana"

#: ui/Panel.qml:101
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Screen tearing reduces latency with most displays. Note that not all "
"graphics drivers support this setting."
msgstr ""
"Cepanje slike smanjuje kašnjenje kod većine ekrana. Imajte u vidu da ovu "
"postavku ne podržavaju svi grafički drajveri."

# >> @item:inlistbox Orientation:
#: ui/RotationButton.qml:54
#, kde-format
msgid "90° Clockwise"
msgstr "90° kazaljke sata"

# >> @item:inlistbox Orientation:
#: ui/RotationButton.qml:58
#, kde-format
msgid "Upside Down"
msgstr "izvrnuto"

# >> @item:inlistbox Orientation:
#: ui/RotationButton.qml:62
#, kde-format
msgid "90° Counterclockwise"
msgstr "90° suprotno kazaljke sata"

#: ui/RotationButton.qml:67
#, kde-format
msgid "No Rotation"
msgstr "bez rotacije"

#: ui/ScreenView.qml:53
#, kde-format
msgid "Drag screens to re-arrange them"
msgstr "Prevucite ekrane da ih preuredite"
